  "description": "Cross-platform report viewer control for Majorsilence Reporting, built on Majorsilence.Forms. Embed RDL/RDLC report viewing, printing (PDF only -- see MIGRATION-NOTES.md), and export in desktop apps. Targets .NET 8 and .NET 10, any OS Majorsilence.Forms.Avalonia supports. To host it in WPF use Majorsilence.Forms.Wpf's ToWpfElement(); for System.Windows.Forms hosts use Majorsilence.Forms.WinForms's ToWinFormsControl().",
